      <li>Do not submit unlawful, abusive, or spam content through the contact form or chat.</li>
      <li>Do not use automated means to scrape the site or abuse its APIs.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. AI assistant</h2>
    <p>
      Chat replies are generated by an AI model and may be inaccurate or incomplete. They are
      informational only and are not professional, legal or binding advice. Do not share
